    "The actual official meeting center is https://burienwa.civicweb.net/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=10 . The city shortcut /i_want_to___/council_meetings redirects to a Castus video URL returning404. Do not repeat that shortcut or the old214487folder as a records search; use actual meeting panels and linked print-version documents.",
    "Resolve actual November9and any later902outcome from an adopted record or executed instrument. The November9packet contains proposed902text and DRAFT October26minutes; the prefilled approval footer does not independently prove approval. Draft minutes report failure3-4-0of a motion to schedule consent adoption, followed by unanimous deferral—not final rejection of the ordinance. Proposed902is geographically specific North of NERA and is not an established replacement of905.",
    "Keep911detention-center moratorium distinct from905data-center moratorium. Isolated data-center wording in detention-center agenda bills does not establish an extension or replacement of905. Relevant later amendments, judicial developments and present legal force remain unverified."
  ],
